    {
      "type": "text",
      "json": [
        {
          "text": "There are rituals that exist to create various elemental motes.  These motes are used in a multitude of crafting recipes, so I should consider setting up places to perform them with means to get there easily.\n\nThere is one ritual/mote for each affinity. \n\nThe mote rituals all have special conditions required in order to perform the ritual.  I have documented them in this Codex under the ritual's specific entry. \n\nThe rituals are: \n"
        },
        {
          "text": "Ritual of the Endless Void",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": " / "
        },
        {
          "text": "Mote of Ender ",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "text": "Ritual of Forgotten Lore",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": " / "
        },
        {
          "text": "Mote of Magic ",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "text": "Ritual of the Untamed Wind",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": " / "
        },
        {
          "text": "Mote of Air ",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "text": "Ritual of the Searing Inferno",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": " / "
        },
        {
          "text": "Mote of Fire",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": " \n"
        },
        {
          "text": "Ritual of the Deep Ocean",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": " / "
        },
        {
          "text": "Mote of Water ",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "text": "Ritual of Ancient Stone",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": " / "
        },
        {
          "text": "Mote of Earth",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n\nThese rituals are ideal candidates for a "
        },
        {
          "text": "Practitioner's Pouch",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": " upgraded with a few "
        },
        {
          "text": "Patches",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": ", which will allow them to be made with significantly more speed and ease."
